{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"566265a26284645471efead2e0d795ddf9ecf1dd4fd606647032be02dbf83d49","digest":{"component_or_area":"review-bot Gerrit adapter","key_entities":["src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py","src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py","src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py","src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py","_summarize()","_translate_findings()","post_vote()","get_revision_files()","render_findings_block()","parse_anchor()","partition_findings()","build_inline_comments()","tests/unit/test_review_bot.py","tests/unit/test_review_bot_finding_publish.py"],"problem_keywords":["advisory findings","review bot","visibility","gerrit integration","message rendering","inline comments"],"propositions":["Advisory finding text is never enumerated in Gerrit change messages; only a count appears on both PASS and BLOCK vote paths.","Finding locations are discarded at adapter.py:114 (_translate_findings), preventing inline comment anchoring even if rendering were attempted.","The review-bot's post_vote call site never supplies the robot_comments parameter, and robot comments are disabled on this Gerrit server, making the message body the only proven rendering surface.","Advisory findings must be rendered in the message body on both PASS and BLOCK paths, with inline comments added for findings whose locations anchor to real revision files.","On inline comment posting failure, the vote must still land with an explicit notice referencing the durable code_review artifact rather than silent fallback."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1786579289947932056,"uuid":"c2e69